Cell[TextData[{
 "Note. Your ",
 StyleBox["can\[CloseCurlyQuote]t choose (hyper)surface",
  FontColor->RGBColor[1, 0, 0]],
 " for the examples below, since automatic definitions of a1[t], A1[t], \
...etc  will include the additional basis elements (with one more independent \
index than is allowed) that will spoil multiplication procedure for basis \
elements. Curvilinear coordinates should be ok (not tested yet properly, \
however, see notebook for curvilinear space)."
}], "Text",
