Cell["\<\
Since identity is valid for geometric product, it should be valid for inner \
and outer product separately.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.889861360388525*^9, 
  3.889861409565963*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a961cbfa-bf2d-48de-8bdf-\
